ction="next" aria-label="Next slide" data-rid="82c0b2f7-9257-4339-acea-c5408e9f018e" class="r-76vf8z"><div data-rid="a9f6e363-bc7c-49ae-ba10-3956235ef180" class="r-8hdpe5"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-11yjpy9" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.646 1.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0l6 6a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L10.293 8 4.646 2.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="62353844-9026-4f10-a47a-09e728061456" class="r-147r9vo"><div data-rid="8a5d5764-f8df-423e-9a0b-83b3212e1ece" class="r-bd0pxq"><div data-rid="22bd91d3-6b2d-4b52-9b59-d76c765bb82b" class="r-q2k0ox alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>A Family Commitment</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="4603409b-3d38-44eb-8834-8e2c20e75f68" class="r-1989qgq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>"We’re not mad at wild-caught seafood, just disappointed."</p></span></div><div data-rid="6b9f4f50-a918-4610-8bb6-28ddbf94e686" class="r-pynt03"><div data-rid="9ad20f15-28a8-4528-bce8-88b44df6980e" class="r-m53rkl"><div data-rid="a6e2b099-642d-495b-b809-96ed052f6b27" class="r-wfozno alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>Did you know toxic heavy metals like Mercury as well as PCBs, MicroPlastics, Parasites and even Glyphosate can all make their way into your seafood? Some of these harmful toxics have been linked to cancer, impaired brain development, adverse reproductive outcomes. As parents we knew we had to do better for our kids, so we founded Seatopia so that you can access the cleanest seafood directly from the world's best artisan regenerative aquaculture farms.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="31130e4d-f4b4-441e-a153-eb06af50abbc" class="r-dlnqvd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span>"Our mission is not only to provide seafood that's free from conta